main.cpp
--cpp17 --object-bits 12 --unwind 4 --no-unwinding-assertions
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ emplace_back pair with non-default-constructible member: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
