--
--
Instantiating vector<pair<T,U>>::emplace_back with a
non-default-constructible T hard-fails a constrained pair constructor
instead of discarding it ([temp.deduct]/8).  Root ingredient of the
sharing_node pair<ssa_exprt,...> failures in the goto_symex_state and
abstract_environment dog-food TUs.
